      "side": 1,
      "message": "`zassert_mem_equal` expects the size in **bytes**, not elements. Since `buf1` and `buf2` are arrays of `uint16_t` (2 bytes each), passing `2` as the size only compares the first 2 bytes (i.e. just the first element `buf1[0]`). \n\nIt should be `2 * sizeof(uint16_t)`.",
